== Trivia ==
* The Starter Deck will paint a five-color pentagram on Isaac's head, which is a reference to the ''Magic: The Gathering'' logo.
* This item is used in {{chal|It's in the Cards}}.
* {{Dlc|r}} Starter Deck also appears in {{chal|Cantripped!|n}} with a unique function of increasing the number of item cards that {{C|Tainted Cain}} can carry at once. It replaces all {{R|Boss Room}} items in this challenge.

